@startuml
title UC-07 Register a return

|Librarian|
start
:Scan the barcode of the returned copy;
if (barcode readable?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Enter the inventory number (1a);
endif
|System|
if (copy on loan?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Display an error message (2a);
  stop
endif
:Close the loan,\nrecord the return date;
if (returned late?) then (yes)
  :Suspend the member\n(extension point: late return);
else (no)
endif
if (copy reserved by\nanother member?) then (yes)
  :Keep the copy aside;
  |Mail server|
  :Notify the member who reserved it;
  |System|
else (no)
  :Make the copy available;
endif
:Print the receipt;
stop
@enduml
